Thu Oct  8 06:27:47 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal <mpluskal@suse.com>

- Update to 1.55.15 (crosses 1.55.14, superseded the same
  day; only 1.55.15 is submitted):
  * Model downloads no longer drop a completed download after
    an earlier failed status, and warn when first and last
    frames have different aspect ratios
  * Canvas: floating workflow tabs, prompt height preserved
    beside image previews, autogrow slots reconnect without
    a refresh
  * Workflows: missing entries dropped from openWorkflows,
    no more activation crash on a null active state
  * Upstream's Comfy Agent side panel is cloud-only and is
    compiled out of this build, so the agent credit-warning,
    telemetry, attachment and auth fixes in this range land
    in source this package does not ship
  * Vendored DOMPurify stays at 3.4.13
  * Many more fixes and improvements; see upstream's release
    notes for the full list
- No packaging change: setup.py still declares no runtime
  requirements

