Sun Oct  4 06:49:52 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal <mpluskal@suse.com>

- Update to 1.54.12:
  * Template search no longer breaks when a custom node ships a
    template whose name collides with a built-in one
  * Manager: version choices are spelled out and a failed pack
    installation is now reported instead of silently stalling
  * Comfy Agent changes upstream in this range are not in this
    package: upstream dead-code-eliminates the agent panel from its
    OSS build (the __DISTRIBUTION__ seam in useAgentDockMount.ts),
    so its consent, reconnect, attachment, paywall and
    starter-prompt fixes land in source this package does not ship
  * Vendored DOMPurify stays at 3.4.13; upstream's package.json
    dependency set is unchanged across this range
  * Many more fixes and improvements; see upstream's release
    notes for the full list

