Wed Sep 30 08:06:03 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal <mpluskal@suse.com>

- Update to 1.54.8:
  * Harden HTML sanitization against attribute breakout, form
    injection and javascript: URLs
  * Adopt comfy-multiplayer 0.3.6 for agent multiplayer sync
  * Agent: fix node-id collisions on CRDT-bound graphs, composer
    paste also pasting the last copied node, canvas freeze after a
    lost touchend, TDZ crash restoring multiline widget values
  * Workflows: keep subgraph definitions consistent across
    convert-to-subgraph, materialize insert_workflow links with
    numeric ids, detach locally deleted open workflows
  * Restore Impact, WAS Pause and RefMod custom-node compatibility
  * Fix promoted dynamic combo child links on load, allow nodes to
    shrink after content growth, skip document-wide modal scans
    while typing

-------------------------------------------------------------------
Tue Sep 22 17:11:34 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal <mpluskal@suse.com>

- Update to 1.54.7:
  * API nodes now gate the Run button and auto-queue on local
    installs: a graph containing one refuses to run until a Comfy
    account is signed in. The gate defaults on, and the
    partner_run_gate_enabled server flag is the only way off
  * Upstream's new Comfy Agent side panel is cloud-only and is
    compiled out of this build
  * German added as a UI language
  * Node help, text previews, markdown widgets and update toasts
    render HTML through one central sanitising component
  * Subgraph links that reference a missing node or slot are
    rejected before the subgraph is unpacked
  * Image upload widgets now accept .exr next to image/*
  * Node render geometry is cached and the progress overlay only
    redraws when it changes
  * Primitive node widget values survive a workflow reload, and a
    non-numeric value in a persisted numeric widget no longer
    stops the canvas render loop
  * Many more fixes and improvements; see upstream's release
    notes for the full list

-------------------------------------------------------------------
Mon Sep  7 06:38:03 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal <mpluskal@suse.com>

- Update to 1.52.7:
  * Moves to the 1.52 line, which is ahead of the version ComfyUI's
    own requirements.txt names; read as static data, and upstream's
    version check only warns when below the pin
  * Node display names, widget labels, output names and tooltips now
    resolved from the backend at read time -- extensions must key on
    widget.name, not widget.label
  * Client-side video metadata extraction via mediabunny; 3D camera
    widget for CreateCameraInfo; RESOLUTION_PREVIEW readout widget
  * Non-UUID workflow ids lazily migrated to a fresh UUID
  * Static v-html sinks removed
  * Ctrl/Cmd shortcuts no longer fall through to the browser; hidden
    ARIA dialogs no longer block global shortcuts
  * API key user authentication restored
  * Comfy Cloud partner nodes branded on canvas and in the registry
- Bundled DOMPurify 3.4.7 -> 3.4.13, which fixes:
  * CVE-2026-65898: permanent ALLOWED_ATTR pollution via setConfig()
  * CVE-2026-65899: Trusted Types policy survives clearConfig()
  * CVE-2026-65900: SAFE_FOR_TEMPLATES bypass inside <template>
  * GHSA-55q2-fjhq-7xh7: XSS, IN_PLACE hook removal leaves a
    detached subtree executable
  * GHSA-c2j3-45gr-mqc4: CUSTOM_ELEMENT_HANDLING bypasses
    afterSanitizeElements

-------------------------------------------------------------------
Thu Aug 27 06:19:04 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal <mpluskal@suse.com>

- Update to 1.51.9:
  * Render node search highlights as plain text instead of generated
    HTML, and restrict localhost downloads from the missing-model
    dialog
  * Persist workflow drafts across a page refresh, keep node preview
    images across workflow tab switches and preserve the initial node
    execution state
  * Keep Ctrl/Cmd shortcuts from falling through to the browser, add
    space-bar panning while dragging Vue nodes, and stop Canvas
    Navigation mode resetting to Custom on reload
  * Resolve widget labels, output names and tooltips from the backend
  * Cut minimap change-detection cost on large graphs, and harden the
    VIDEO_EDIT widget and its filmstrip generation
  * Tolerate a missing /api/i18n endpoint and an unusable localStorage
    during bootstrap
  * Replace lobe-i18n with an in-house locale pipeline and repair
    stale and malformed locale data
  * Lift Select and SearchAutocomplete dropdowns above modal dialogs;
    a malformed MatchType spec no longer deletes the input
  * Default an active templates search to Popular instead of Relevance
  * Route all error reports through a single reporter, which adds a
    bundled Datadog browser SDK chunk (Apache-2.0) that this build
    never initialises
  * Assorted node-editor, Cloud billing, workspace and asset fixes -
    see upstream's release notes for the full list

-------------------------------------------------------------------
